WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.102
Today is two tiny words. One of them is the most common word your child will meet.

2
00:00:05.552 --> 00:00:12.364
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:15.444
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:15.944 --> 00:00:19.616
Say the first word, the way you say it in a sentence. The cat.

5
00:00:20.066 --> 00:00:24.435
Two taps. The first two letters are a team. Together they make one sound.

6
00:00:24.885 --> 00:00:29.723
The last letter is the heart part. In this word it makes a soft sound. This one.

7
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.299
Now say the whole word.

8
00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:37.669
The second word is one letter long. Say it as you do in a sentence. A cat.

9
00:00:39.027 --> 00:00:42.301
It is the same soft sound. So this word is all heart.

10
00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:46.849
Your child traces both words and draws the hearts. Then step away.

11
00:00:47.299 --> 00:00:53.640
In job two, your child reads four sentences, marks each one, and writes its number beside its picture.

12
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:59.304
Job three is new today. It is called words from before. Yesterday's words come back.

13
00:00:59.754 --> 00:01:04.836
A word read right away gets a check, and one colored box on the Words I Own chart.

14
00:01:05.286 --> 00:01:08.979
This job is on the page because of forgetting. Do not skip it.
